  "intro": {
    "title": "Ich mag dich",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Mögen is 'to like', used mainly with nouns: Ich mag Pizza, Ich mag dich. For activities, Germans use gern with the verb: Ich schwimme gern. Its forms change: ich mag, du magst."
    ]
  },
